  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support Institutions and Communities to Build Open and Inclusive Society in Kosovo (as per UNSC Res.1244 (1999))</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of the project is to contribute towards more inclusive policies and legislation that non-majority communities will benefit from and therefore improve their resilience to the risk of escalating conflict. At the same time, project is creating linkages between communities, foster cooperation and ultimately contribute towards safe, democratic and developed society for all.</narrative>
  </description>
